<noinclude>
Infobox and Cargo row for a place. Create pages with [[Form:Place]].

Every place has a parent in <code>located_in</code>: another place, or a world at the top.
[[Module:Place]] builds the path, the places below and what is within.

{{#cargo_declare:_table=Places
|type=String (allowed values=Plane,Continent,Region,City,Town,Village,District,Building,Dungeon,Landmark,Wilderness)
|located_in=Page
|ruler=Page
|map=File
|summary=Text
}}

